n\nWhere: Metro Vancouver - North Shore including West Vancouver and North Vancouver.\n\nWhen: Now until tonight.\n\nWhat: 60 to 100 mm of rain, possibly near 120 mm in the mountains.\n\nRemarks: A very robust frontal system is bringing rain to the South Coast. Rain, heavy at times, will continue today before tapering off tonight.\n\nWater will likely pool on roads and in low-lying areas. Visibility will likely be suddenly reduced at times. Landslides may occur in vulnerable areas such as steep slopes, deforested areas or recent burn scars.\n\nWatch for washouts near rivers, creeks and culverts.\n\nPlease continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to BCstorm@ec.gc.ca or post reports on social media using #BCStorm.","alert_text_fr":"De la pluie forte persiste.\n\nO\u00f9 : la r\u00e9gion m\u00e9tropolitaine de Vancouver - North Shore, y compris West Vancouver et North Vancouver.\n\nQuand : de maintenant jusqu'\u00e0 cette nuit.\n\nQuoi : de 60 \u00e0 100 mm de pluie, mais possiblement pr\u00e8s de 120 mm en montagne.\n\nRemarques : un syst\u00e8me frontal tr\u00e8s intense occasionne de la pluie sur la c\u00f4te sud. La pluie parfois forte continuera aujourd'hui avant de cesser peu \u00e0 peu ce soir ou cette nuit.\n\nUne accumulation d\u2019eau est probable sur les routes et dans les basses terres. Une visibilit\u00e9 soudainement r\u00e9duite par moments est \u00e0 pr\u00e9voir. Des\u00a0glissements de terrain peuvent se produire dans des zones vuln\u00e9rables telles que les pentes abruptes, les zones d\u00e9bois\u00e9es ou celles marqu\u00e9es par les cicatrices de feux de for\u00eat r\u00e9cents.\n\nPrenez garde aux affaissements de route pr\u00e8s des rivi\u00e8res, des ruisseaux et des ponceaux.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoBC@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #BCMeteo.","risk_colour_en":"yellow","risk_colour_fr":"jaune","confidence_en":"High","confidence_fr":"\u00e9lev\u00e9e","impact_en":"Moderate","impact_fr":"mod\u00e9r\u00e9","feature_name_en":"Metro Vancouver - North Shore including West Vancouver and North Vancouver","feature_name_fr":"Metro Vancouver - North Shore incluant West Vancouver et North Vancouver","province":"BC","status_en":"continued","status_fr":"maintenu","feature_id":"fea1-2332"}}],"numberMatched":2,"numberReturned":2,"links":[{"type":"application/geo+json","rel":"self","title":"This document as GeoJSON","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=json&bbox=-123.17,49.23,-123.07,49.33"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"application/ld+json","title":"This document as RDF (JSON-LD)","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=jsonld&bbox=-123.17,49.23,-123.07,49.33"},{"type":"text/html","rel":"alternate","title":"This document as HTML","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts/items?f=html&bbox=-123.17,49.23,-123.07,49.33"},{"type":"application/json","title":"Weather Alerts","rel":"collection","href":"https://api.weather.gc.ca/collections/weather-alerts"}],"timeStamp":"2026-11-11T12:53:03.025793Z"}